  "body": "Elevated and brand new, this well-designed home offers practical family living with excellent natural light and space in a sought-after Millwater location.\r\n\r\nSet on approximately 525sqm, the two-level layout is thoughtfully configured to provide separation between living and accommodation. The main living zone features an open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area, oriented to capture all-day sun and opening to a covered deck for easy indoor-outdoor flow.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen is clean and functional with a central island and ample storage, supporting both everyday living and entertaining. The master bedroom is positioned privately on this level with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, while a separate guest toilet adds convenience. Downstairs, three additional double bedrooms are supported by a family bathroom and a second living area, offering flexibility for families, guests, or a media or retreat space.\r\n\r\nComfort is enhanced with central air conditioning.\r\nConveniently located close to local Silverdale or Orewa schools, walkways, Silverdale Shopping Centre, and motorway access, this is a well-balanced home offering space, comfort, and long-term value.\r\n\r\nA quality Millwater home in a location that continues to perform.",
